   "q": "Solve the following linear difference equations with constant coefficients using Z-transform method: a) \\(y(n+2) - 5y(n+1) + 6y(n) = 0\\) , with \\(y(0)=1\\) , \\(y(1)=2\\) . b) \\(y(n+2) - 4y(n) = 0\\) , with \\(y(0)=0\\) , \\(y(1)=2\\) . c) \\(y(n+2) - 3y(n+1) + 2y(n) = 4^n\\) , with \\(y(0)=0\\) , \\(y(1)=1\\) . d) \\(y(n+1) - 2y(n) = n\\) , with \\(y(0)=1\\) .",
